{
 "irVersion": 1,
 "source": {
  "game": "madoka_portable",
  "unit": "Chapter01/01/00_00",
  "textLang": "zh-Hans"
 },
 "title": "Chapter01 01-00_00",
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "1000010",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "唔，今天也是个好天气！\n这种日子真想把课翘掉\n去哪里玩玩呐——",
   "voice": "01_0_00010_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000020",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "嗯！？",
   "voice": "01_0_00020_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000030",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "（是小圆！）",
   "voice": "01_0_00030_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000040",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "昨天真是\n吓了一跳呢！",
   "voice": "01_0_00040_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000050",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "hitomi",
    "name": "仁美",
    "sourceId": 8,
    "code": "sh"
   },
   "text": "嗯，现在想起来\n身体也还抖个不停呢。",
   "voice": "01_0_00050_sh",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000060",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "早上好——！！",
   "voice": "01_0_00060_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000070",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "早上好——。\n沙耶加酱！",
   "voice": "01_0_00070_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000080",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "hitomi",
    "name": "仁美",
    "sourceId": 8,
    "code": "sh"
   },
   "text": "早上好。\n沙耶加同学\n今天也很精神呢。",
   "voice": "01_0_00080_sh",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000090",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "哈哈哈。\n因为再怎么有精神都不用交税嘛！",
   "voice": "01_0_00090_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000100",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "喂，你这不是\n把我说得像个笨蛋一样吗！",
   "voice": "01_0_00100_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000110",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "hitomi",
    "name": "仁美",
    "sourceId": 8,
    "code": "sh"
   },
   "text": "没有这回事呢。",
   "voice": "01_0_00110_sh",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000120",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "精神好最重要！",
   "voice": "01_0_00120_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000130",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "是吗？这样就算了。\n话说刚才你们在聊什么？",
   "voice": "01_0_00130_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000140",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "在说昨天的老鼠。",
   "voice": "01_0_00140_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000150",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "啊，那个啊。",
   "voice": "01_0_00150_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000160",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "好像很有趣的样子呢。",
   "voice": "01_0_00160_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000170",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "啊，麻美学姐！\n早上好！",
   "voice": "01_0_00170_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000180",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "早上好。",
   "voice": "01_0_00180_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000190",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "hitomi",
    "name": "仁美",
    "sourceId": 8,
    "code": "sh"
   },
   "text": "早上好。",
   "voice": "01_0_00190_sh",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000200",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "早上好。\n大家还是\n这么亲热啊。",
   "voice": "01_0_00200_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000210",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "这是当然的啦。\n因为我们是好朋友嘛！",
   "voice": "01_0_00210_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000220",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "好朋友……。真好啊。",
   "voice": "01_0_00220_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000230",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "那么，老鼠怎么了？\n我很好奇啊。",
   "voice": "01_0_00230_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000240",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "昨天上课时有只老鼠跑了出来。",
   "voice": "01_0_00240_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000250",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "上课时？",
   "voice": "01_0_00250_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000260",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "仁美酱吓得不行\n从教室跑出去了哦。",
   "voice": "01_0_00260_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000270",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "hitomi",
    "name": "仁美",
    "sourceId": 8,
    "code": "sh"
   },
   "text": "我最怕老鼠了。\n光看到就吃不消了。",
   "voice": "01_0_00270_sh",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000280",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "我懂的。\n我也很怕老鼠。",
   "voice": "01_0_00280_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000290",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "诶——麻美学姐\n也害怕老鼠吗？",
   "voice": "01_0_00290_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000300",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "嗯，它不是跑得很快吗？\n最怕那种了。",
   "voice": "01_0_00300_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000310",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "真是意外呢！",
   "voice": "01_0_00310_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000320",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "咦，是吗？",
   "voice": "01_0_00320_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000330",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "因为啊，\n总觉得麻美学姐会说：\n“没什么好怕的。”",
   "voice": "01_0_00330_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000340",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "是这样吗？",
   "voice": "01_0_00340_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000350",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "就是这样！",
   "voice": "01_0_00350_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000360",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "被鹿目同学这么一说\n觉得好高兴啊。",
   "voice": "01_0_00360_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000370",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "呵呵……。\n那就太好了。",
   "voice": "01_0_00370_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000380",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "…………\n…………\n……她们俩感情真好啊。",
   "voice": "01_0_00380_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000390",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "hitomi",
    "name": "仁美",
    "sourceId": 8,
    "code": "sh"
   },
   "text": "怎么了？\n沙耶加同学。",
   "voice": "01_0_00390_sh",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000400",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "没什么，\n只是觉得小圆明明才刚和麻美学姐认识不久\n关系马上就变得这么好了。",
   "voice": "01_0_00400_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000410",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "hitomi",
    "name": "仁美",
    "sourceId": 8,
    "code": "sh"
   },
   "text": "这么说来也是呢。",
   "voice": "01_0_00410_sh",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000420",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "总有一种\n青梅竹马被抢走了的感觉啊……。",
   "voice": "01_0_00420_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000430",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "hitomi",
    "name": "仁美",
    "sourceId": 8,
    "code": "sh"
   },
   "text": "…………。",
   "voice": "01_0_00430_sh",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000440",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "美树同学。\n我把鹿目同学抢走了\n真不好意思。",
   "voice": "01_0_00440_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000450",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "诶？？",
   "voice": "01_0_00450_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000460",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "不小心听到了\n美树同学的话。",
   "voice": "01_0_00460_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000470",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "啊，\n我说这话并没有什么奇怪的意思！",
   "voice": "01_0_00470_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000480",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "因为啊，\n麻美学姐很有可靠的姐姐的感觉。\n小圆想要去亲近我也能理解。",
   "voice": "01_0_00480_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000490",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "美树同学也是啊，\n作为鹿目同学的青梅竹马\n肯定也被鹿目同学所依赖着哦。",
   "voice": "01_0_00490_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000500",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "是、是吗？",
   "voice": "01_0_00500_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000510",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "mami",
    "name": "巴麻美",
    "sourceId": 2,
    "code": "ma"
   },
   "text": "是的哦，你安心吧。",
   "voice": "01_0_00510_ma",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000520",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "你们两个怎么了？\n突然在那里停下来……。",
   "voice": "01_0_00520_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000530",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "什、什么都没有！\n我们在说啊，\n小圆今天也好可爱哦——什么的。",
   "voice": "01_0_00530_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000540",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "诶，沙耶加酱\n突然说什么呢——。",
   "voice": "01_0_00540_md",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000550",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "sayaka",
    "name": "美树沙耶香",
    "sourceId": 1,
    "code": "sa"
   },
   "text": "喂，大家要快点了！\n这么下去会迟到的哦！",
   "voice": "01_0_00550_sa",
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1000560",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "speaker": {
    "cast": "madoka",
    "name": "鹿目圆",
    "sourceId": 0,
    "code": "md"
   },
   "text": "嗯！　快走吧！",
   "voice": "01_0_00560_md",
   "cues": []
  }
 ]
}